        "slc_cba0a49c47372cf48df1ecebdc6cde29c1f298f8a728edcf7aa1a6bb09779ac3"
      ],
      "text": "Global keybindings include ctrl+space to switch between Kanban and Search modes, ctrl+o to enter Orchestration/Dashboard mode, ? for help, and ctrl+c to quit."
    },
