        "slc_63ae72dbd08605250eb9ef9e9962920c1a87c7a2fd281e462c556ca009ec5ae2"
      ],
      "text": "The Control Plane comprises ControlPlane (lifecycle entry point), Registry (in-memory workflow storage), Supervisor, ResourceScheduler, HealthMonitor, and CrossWorkflowEventBus."
    },
