      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_63d1280f7ca6bd29690b470a4e547caba519028fca79078bc01b30e59ea9a635"
      ],
      "text": "Since Cursor lacks --append-system-prompt, Perles prepends the system prompt to the main prompt with a blank line separator, the same approach used for OpenCode."
    },
